{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "def check_occurences(list_of_tuples):\n    from collections import defaultdict\n\n    class InvalidTupleElementException(TypeError):\n        def __init__(self, message):\n            super().__init__(message)\n\n    def normalize_tuple(input_tuple):\n        return tuple(sorted(input_tuple))\n\n    counts = defaultdict(int)\n    for item_tuple in list_of_tuples:\n        try:\n            normalized_tuple = normalize_tuple(item_tuple)\n            counts[normalized_tuple] += 1\n        except TypeError as e:\n            raise InvalidTupleElementException(\n                f\"Tuple element comparison failed: {e}. Ensure all elements \"\n                f\"within tuples are comparable. Problematic tuple: {item_tuple}\"\n            ) from e\n    return dict(counts)"}
