{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "```python\ndef min_product_tuple(data: list[tuple[int | float, int | float]]) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum product from pairs of numbers within a given list of tuples.\n\n    Args:\n        data: A list of tuples, where each tuple contains exactly two numeric values.\n\n    Returns:\n        An integer or float representing the minimum product found.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If 'data' is not a list, or if any element in 'data' is not a tuple.\n        ValueError: If 'data' is an empty list, if any tuple does not contain exactly\n                    two numeric elements, or if elements within a tuple are not numeric.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(data, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input 'data' must be a list.\")\n    if not data:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'data' list cannot be empty.\")\n\n    min_prod = float('inf')\n\n    for i, item in enumerate(data):\n        if not isinstance(item, tuple):\n            raise TypeError(f\"Element at index {i} must be a tuple, got {type(item).__name__}.\")\n        if len(item) != 2:\n            raise ValueError(f\"Tuple at index {i} must contain exactly two elements, got {len(item)}.\")\n        \n        num1, num2 = item\n        if not (isinstance(num1, (int, float)) and isinstance(num2, (int, float))):\n            raise ValueError(f\"Elements in tuple at index {i} must be numeric, got types {type(num1).__name__} and {type(num2).__name__}.\")\n\n        current_prod = num1 * num2\n        if current_prod < min_prod:\n            min_prod = current_prod\n            \n    return min_prod\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/410", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Union\n\ndef min_val(data_list: List[any]) -> Union[int, float, None]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum numeric value in a heterogeneous list, ignoring non-numeric elements.\n    Returns the minimum integer or float found, or None if no numeric values are present.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_value = None\n    for item in data_list:\n        if isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n            if min_value is None or item < min_value:\n                min_value = item\n    return min_value\n```"}
