{"task_id": "Mbpp/412", "solution": "```python\ndef remove_odd(numbers: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a list of integers, returning a new list containing only the even numbers.\n    Raises TypeError if input is not a list or contains non-integer elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(numbers, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    even_numbers = []\n    for num in numbers:\n        if not isinstance(num, int):\n            raise TypeError(f\"All elements in the list must be integers, but found type {type(num).__name__}.\")\n        if num % 2 == 0:\n            even_numbers.append(num)\n    return even_numbers\n```"}
