{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "```python\ndef get_coordinates(coordinate: tuple[int, int]) -> list[list[int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all 9 adjacent coordinates (including itself) of the given coordinate tuple.\n    Returns a list of lists, where each inner list represents an adjacent coordinate [x_adj, y_adj].\n    \"\"\"\n    x, y = coordinate\n    adjacent = []\n    for dx in [-1, 0, 1]:\n        for dy in [-1, 0, 1]:\n            adjacent.append([x + dx, y + dy])\n    return adjacent\n```"}
