{"task_id": "Mbpp/770", "solution": "```python\ndef odd_num_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the fourth powers of the first 'n' odd natural numbers.\n    Raises ValueError if 'n' is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        odd_number = 2 * i + 1\n        total_sum += odd_number ** 4\n    return total_sum\n```"}
